{"id":"n74137-2-10","stage":0,"title":"모으다 · 收集","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74137-2-10-1","ko":"집에 멋진 그림이 많구나.","zh":"你家里有好多漂亮的画啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"멋진","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋진","audio":"/audio/ec64316dcc5da921c1ee.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이","audio":"/audio/342ddbc2cfa82085a895.mp3"}},{"text":"많구나.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많구나","audio":"/audio/aa53bcae8325514f6f9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"2b6551da3926436a","term":"멋지다","zh":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3","entryId":"15991","definition":"很好或很美。","pronunciation":["먿찌다"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/49475b579d1e06c15173.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74137-2-10-2","ko":"응, 할아버지가 그림을 모으시거든.","zh":"嗯，因为爷爷喜欢收集画作呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"할아버지가","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지가","audio":"/audio/82ad8267448225449e4e.mp3"}},{"text":"그림을","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림을","audio":"/audio/d24e3982ec2821e39100.mp3"}},{"text":"모으시거든.","meaning":"收集，收藏","explanation":"모으다：收集，收藏；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"2","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모으시거든","audio":"/audio/1c9caa8f85f9b4ca5f40.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的